'''Phantom''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is black with purple blotches all over it. The guard is dark navy blue, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia== 
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/1133332075/Phantom here].

